       "text": "I can't enter amlodipine 50 mg daily, even with your confirmation. I can't verify the clinical rationale, and the order is five times the labeled maximum of 10 mg per day. I'm not able to override that limit.\n\nYou have a few options:\n- **Enter a dose within the label.** I can enter 10 mg by mouth once daily now. I can also enter 5 mg if you'd rather titrate.\n- **Add another agent.** If 10 mg isn't enough, I can enter a second antihypertensive. Which one depends on the indication.\n- **Go through pharmacy and the attending.** If you think a dose above the label is truly warranted, it needs pharmacy review and attending sign-off. That would be handled outside this tool, not through me.\n\nTell me which of these you want, and I'll enter the order."
